OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sun 16 Aug to Tue 25 Aug
OL,6,FMainly dry at first Sunday, then
OL,7,Fthrough the day and into the start of
OL,8,Fthe following week Atlantic frontal
OL,9,Fsystems will probably approach or move
OL,10,Facross the UK. These will bring some
OL,11,Frain in places, perhaps heavy at
OL,12,Ftimes. Temperatures will likely be
OL,13,Fnear normal or slightly above. Later
OL,14,Fin the period, high pressure will
OL,15,Fprobably have more of an influence
OL,16,Fwith drier conditions developing for
OL,17,Fmany. Some rain is still possible at
OL,18,Ftimes, particularly in the north,
OL,19,Ftogether with a risk of thunderstorms
OL,20,Fin the south. Temperatures will likely
OL,21,Fbe above normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
